Hello, Horde!

The big day is approaching faster than minions fetching Moriana her morning coffee (black as the void and cold as ice, if you're wondering). And it’s closer than you think… In fact, we see no reason to keep teasing the date of your journey to Hell. So, without further ado...

THE “WELCOME TO HELL” UPDATE WILL BE AVAILABLE ON MAY 26TH, 10:00 AM (PST) / 7:00 PM (CEST)

To celebrate this fiery milestone, we’ve prepared a short but explosive trailer—packed with flames, demons, and chaos. Enjoy!

[previewyoutube=gXLE7RQlJrk;full][/previewyoutube]
What can you expect from this massive update to Be My Horde? We'll dive deep into the details on Monday with the launch, but here’s a quick overview:

💀 An entirely new level—Hell;

💀 Brand-new enemies to kill and resurrect—some are ranged units;

💀 A new feature: hostile environment that fights you: volcanoes, bombarding rocks, exploding blobs, and… fire tornadoes!

💀 New FREEZING perks for Moriana to cool things down;

💀 An all-new Talent Tree system;

💀 A fearsome new boss—the Devil (voiced by Jacob Browning), complete with his own story and an intriguing relationship with Moriana;

💀 New dialogues between Moriana and the player in the Dominion;

💀 And of course, dozens of improvements and additions!

All of this is coming May 26th! We won’t lie—we're stressed as hell (hehe). These past few months have been a huge challenge. We overcame a mountain of obstacles to bring our vision to life. We never wanted this to be just a simple reskin—we aimed to craft something truly fresh. It was tough, especially considering we originally planned this update for March (oops). But we’ve poured everything we have into it, and we hope you’ll love it. Moriana won’t forgive you if you don’t. Okay?

Stay tuned for May 26th, and as always…

PRAISE BE MORIANA!
The Polished Games Team

