Greetings, minions!

The moment you've been waiting for is finally here—our first major update for Be My Horde! Without further ado, let's dive straight into what's new and exciting.

NEW SCROLLS OF FATE

We want to extend our gratitude for all your suggestions and feedback on the Scrolls of Fate feature. We've taken a closer look and not only rebalanced the existing scrolls (details in the "Rebalance" section), but we've also added SIX brand-new ones. These additions will allow you to further customize your playthrough and discover new ways to play Be My Horde. Let's explore the new scrolls!

💀 Aura of Decay - Activating this Scroll creates a magic circle around Moriana that damages any hostile units that approach. While you still need to protect the necromancess, she's no longer completely defenseless!

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44366003/415157c8bc9878f10d8c684e68f9543769bdd3c2.gif

💀 Swift Decay - Some of you noticed that you could rot the in-game trees, but it was just a visual effect. Not anymore. With this new Scroll, you can gain a temporary speed boost by corrupting any tree in your path. And yes, the buff adds up, so the more rotten trees in a row, the longer you stay faster.

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44366003/d7dffc8f628988268dd58c24b92ffe7b3be6c420.gif

